  "body_md": "**Subject: Upcoming Feature: Activity Timeline for Claims**

We are pleased to announce that a new chronological activity timeline will be included in our next release bundle.

This feature displays key events, user actions, and system updates for each claim in a clear, scrollable interface. The goal is to improve case tracking and accountability within your workflow.

Please note that this change is not live immediately. It will become available to your team once the release bundle is announced and an administrator switches on the corresponding feature flag."
